WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.699
Some strings contain meaningful internal structure
An email address

00:00:05.725 --> 00:00:11.323
has a delimiter between the user portion and domain
If the delimiter

00:00:11.349 --> 00:00:17.666
is reliable SPLIT_PART can extract pieces based on
structure This

00:00:17.693 --> 00:00:22.824
is usually easier to understand than using fixed
character positions which can break when string

00:00:22.837 --> 00:00:23.587
lengths vary
